  clock: 3  # 84c9
  nonce: 84c9  # 84c9
  message: "Shipped via PR (merged via fast-forward, commit 1d24981). Added 4 template-form regexes (Napi::Function::New<F>, InstanceMethod<&C::M>, StaticMethod<&C::M>, InstanceAccessor) to napi.py. 4 new property tests; 100% coverage. CAVEAT: tracker's better-sqlite3 fixture is V8-direct (not N-API). Real N-API consumers (sharp, canvas, …) benefit. better-sqlite3's V8-direct bindings remain unbridged and would require a separate v8_bindings.py linker."  # 84c9
- op: discuss  # 76aa
