  clock: 4  # 76aa
  nonce: 76aa  # 76aa
  message: "Cohort validation 2026-05-19: MOVED on canvas + sharp (N-API). Post-fix metrics: canvas hypergumbo run (12s, 1544 nodes, 3154 edges) — napi-linker-v1 emits 1 edge (cpp:src/color.cc:741-751:rgba_from_name_string -> cpp:src/CanvasRenderingContext2d.cc:2363-2379), 8 Symbols carry napi meta. sharp run (16s, 1204 nodes, 1812 edges) — 7 Symbols with napi meta (no linker edges in this run but 4 template-form regex patterns are firing at the symbol level). The 4 new template-form regexes (Napi::Function::New<F>, InstanceMethod<&C::M>, StaticMethod<&C::M>, InstanceAccessor) are empirically present in the analyzer output. Low edge magnitude on canvas (1) and zero on sharp suggests the template-form match surface is narrow, but the structural fix is demonstrably operating."  # 76aa
